  "scientific_review": [
    "Ten declared fixed-latitude sections on March/June/September/December15,2022 00Z remain40cases. Retain exact native u/v,signed0degree northward or180degree southward components,coordinates,indices,hyperslabs,timestamps,metadata,nulls,candidate scores/local peaks and all selected5/10/20cm/s layers. No unsuccessful,edge or primary-censored case is omitted.",
