    "Mauritania uses complete finite50-300m positive northward integral with core>10cm/s;Baffin100-300m positive southward integral with core>5cm/s. Neither has a positive surface gate,relative surface comparison or thermal gate. Greatest integral wins,first western native tie;gate/support-edge winners stay unresolved without weaker interior replacement or tuning. Sensitivities use their own qualifying seed at the same selected column.",
    "Mauritania17-19N/18.5-16W targets partial poleward boundary-flow context around18N. Fresh Klenz2018 publisher text distinguishes winter subsurface flow below the equatorward jet from relaxation surface-reaching poleward flow,and proposes naming both poleward branches together. Historical remapped seasonal means,core bands and reach scales do not validate2022 axes,paired physical boundaries or annual bounds. Fixed northward does not rotate along curved coastlines;equatorward Canary/coastal flow is not the target.",
    "Baffin74.5-68.5N has declared changing longitude gates along a partial external coastal/slope context. Fresh Carroll2018 publisher Section2.1 separates southward Baffin Island Current from northward WGC;its Arctic-water100-300m band is a component context,not current thickness or bottom. Velocity alone does not classify water masses. Exclude WGC,Lancaster intrusion,Arctic strait feeders,fjords and southern Davis continuation. Fjord/sill bathymetry and2013-2015 fjord records do not validate2022 current axes.",
    "Existing Mauritania summer surface and Baffin summer near-surface editorial routes remain separate from quarterly interval geometry. Later independent regional connectors must not replace/extrapolate those routes or imply observed seasonal/depth trajectories. Gates/stops and windows/cutoffs are OSW diagnostic choices,not extracted axes,widths,uncertainty intervals or complete named-current extents.",
    "Coastal dry/slope support,ice-masked fields,meanders and neighboring/mesoscale flow can censor or confound geographic maxima. Full native0-5000m adjacent finite crossings keep upper/lower contours,statuses,last supported bounds and paired spans distinct. Window endpoints,historical water-mass/core/reach bands,instrument coverage,sills,bed and domain limits are not physical bottoms. Same-sign deep flow can connect;paired model span is not physical thickness.",
    "All frozen helpers/older sources remain unchanged. Exact bounded retries reserve future first attempts and never replay successful components. Ledger counts requested/decoded quantities,not wire traffic or physical precision. All acquisition,numerics,audits,geometry/contours and tests ran sequentially in cloud on one idle CPU.",
